The shop assistant takes out a bag.
"No thank you," I say.
I put my new clothes on right away.
I put the thick red sweater on.
I wear it under my thin jacket.
Afterwards, I take the long blue scarf.
I put the scarf around my neck.
Finally, I put the warm black gloves on.
The thick gloves are very comfortable.
"Goodbye," I say to the shop assistant.
"Have a good day," she smiles.
I walk out of the shop.
I stand out on the cold street.
It is still a dark winter day.
The wind is blowing a lot.
But I am not freezing anymore.
I am wearing all my new warm clothes.
Now I am completely warm.
I smile.
I am finally ready for the Danish winter.
